      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "血は最高だ……！　特に死闘を繰り広げた相手を\n俺の斧で切り裂いて、浴びる熱い血はな……！\n鮮血が、傷ついた身体に力を与えてくれる。\nさあ、俺の所へ来い……その血で俺を満たしてくれ！",
        "official_en": "Blood...how I crave it! Sweet blood, pulsing from the\nfoes whose heads I sssplit, is the most delicious. It is\nmy strength! And I will taste yoursss! Let us duel!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
