      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "血は最高だ……惨めに敗れた自分の身体から\n流れる汚くて臭い血もまた愛おしい……\n満足したぜ。俺の技をお前に伝える。\nその技で血を啜り、せいぜい生き延びてくれ。",
        "official_en": "Blood...is all I need. Even the foul blood that runs\nfrom my defeated body has its sssavor... You\ndessserve to learn my technique. Use it to tassste the\nblood of your foes!",
